Hi all,

Making some packages, and having "some" problems with the dependencies,
I was wondering if it possible to increment a sort of R CMD check2 that
do all the steps of the R CMD check except the "* checking package
dependencies".

That would help to process all the check command and avoid the circular
references problem, which is quite common.
This command would obviously be used only if the normal command can not
be used.

What do you think of ?
Is it possible ?

Thanks in advance
~pingou

	

	
		
